sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Browser
  participant Worker as Cloudflare Worker
  participant Runtime as Local Stream Runtime
  participant Ollama as Ollama 127.0.0.1
  participant Provider as DeepSeek/Kimi/Qwen/Zhipu API
  participant Runner as Local Agent Runner

  Runner->>Worker: register manifests / heartbeat / result state
  Browser->>Worker: GET /agent/healthz
  Worker->>Runtime: signed GET /healthz
  Runtime-->>Worker: public health snapshot
  Worker-->>Browser: online / degraded / offline
  Browser->>Worker: POST /agent/chat
  Worker->>Worker: origin, size, optional Turnstile, timeout
  Worker->>Runtime: signed POST /agent/chat
  Runtime->>Runtime: verify HMAC and agent manifest
  alt owner-trained local agent
    Runtime->>Ollama: streaming /api/chat on loopback
    Ollama-->>Runtime: token chunks
  else provider API agent
    Runtime->>Provider: OpenAI-compatible chat completion
    Provider-->>Runtime: hosted model answer
  end
  Runtime-->>Worker: SSE meta / delta / done / error
  Worker-->>Browser: same SSE stream
  Runtime-->>Runner: optional future chat.completed audit event
